# Copy to `.env` or `.env.local` and adjust. Vite reads these at dev/build time.
# Default in code is http://localhost:8000 — only set this if your API URL differs.
#
# If port 8000 is taken by another app, run FastAPI on another port, e.g.:
#   PYTHONPATH=server uvicorn app.main:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8001
# then:
# VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8001
